<title>USA: Evergreen Media Corp Q1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Media Corp Q1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					 Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net revenues				  $81,897   $53,371</p>
